{"3943530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Birdweb", "steam_appid": 3943530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Birdweb</strong> is a <strong>cozy multiplayer  game</strong> about <strong>hanging out</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You spawn on a small island surrounded by open water and are free to spend your time however you want. Fly around and chill &amp; chat with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just relax and enjoy the atmosphere, Birdweb lets you play your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice and text chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small open world made for relaxing and exploring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun social world where you can do whatever you feel like</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birdweb is all about good vibes, relaxing sessions, and making memories with friends by the water.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Birdweb</strong> is a <strong>cozy multiplayer  game</strong> about <strong>hanging out</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You spawn on a small island surrounded by open water and are free to spend your time however you want. Fly around and chill &amp; chat with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just relax and enjoy the atmosphere, Birdweb lets you play your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice and text chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small open world made for relaxing and exploring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun social world where you can do whatever you feel like</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birdweb is all about good vibes, relaxing sessions, and making mem